//si.imgix.net/a2e94ea1/uploads/origins/5417754d-f862-471d-8c84-6a61a9718650?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f9b03e950b0073d594104c0c985bcbe0, https://si.imgix.net/a2e94ea1/uploads/origins/5417754d-f862-471d-8c84-6a61a9718650?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c6f81512bdeea636ba9fb18984a717d4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a2e94ea1/uploads/origins/5417754d-f862-471d-8c84-6a61a9718650?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a8e61a4992d7b1d02c0da64f683f2ba5 3x"}, "body": "hello, thank you so much for the last drawing you did of my character. i loved it so much that i really wanted to send another request, if it's okay! i was so happy when i received it. i'd like you to draw a full body illustration of the same character as a magical girl. you can have full freedom on everything: her expression, her hair, her outfit (but please with her character elements!). i really enjoyed the cute pose you drew, i would like if you could draw an interesting pose again for me! the only thing is that i'd like her to have some cute staff or wand. she also has a pastel coloured version, so i will leave it here as well, and you can choose which version you would like to draw! thank you so much for considering my request, and thank you again for the beautiful artpiece you drew.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1rBWmLHxTLaA1Tq54II6FCS6OxUU9sfjG/view?usp=sharing\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1TNsq1BKnW6tkP9vYkpVLY1YG4Wx2MqCl/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@NYAsan/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3906024, "client_id": 3763177, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b1479382/uploads/origins/11554ddb-bfce-4e49-a4e3-f3bb0c82f0b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1fa685f92be88f108565a5e31f095a7d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b1479382/uploads/origins/11554ddb-bfce-4e49-a4e3-f3bb0c82f0b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1fa685f92be88f108565a5e31f095a7d, https://si.imgix.net/b1479382/uploads/origins/11554ddb-bfce-4e49-a4e3-f3bb0c82f0b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d7bdb37561186dab9bc3bcb410b7771 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b1479382/uploads/origins/11554ddb-bfce-4e49-a4e3-f3bb0c82f0b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09a48868bdf14a5368d75eab5ce15fb1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b1479382/uploads/origins/11554ddb-bfce-4e49-a4e3-f3bb0c82f0b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=94f73805f15a78382c7faecb7c8181f4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b1479382/uploads/origins/11554ddb-bfce-4e49-a4e3-f3bb0c82f0b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=94f73805f15a78382c7faecb7c8181f4, https://si.imgix.net/b1479382/uploads/origins/11554ddb-bfce-4e49-a4e3-f3bb0c82f0b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=751cb88a70f8211452ffbae905c94924 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b1479382/uploads/origins/11554ddb-bfce-4e49-a4e3-f3bb0c82f0b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ef8902b6b251c4d01854b166b100be3e 3x"}, "body": "𝙉𝙔𝘼様\n\nはじめまして。\nゲーム配信をしております個人Vtuberの如月もこと申します。\n\nイラストを拝見させて頂き、とっても可愛らしい作品ばかりで\nお色の塗り方もとっても素敵で惹かれたので是非わたくしを描いて頂ければと思い\nリクエストをさせていただきます！\n\n【使用用途】\n配信サムネイルがメインです。\n（未定ではありますがメンバーシップ特典やグッズ制作でも利用するかもしれません。）\n\n【如月もこの特徴】\n・ほんの少し垂れ目で瞳の中の星や、差し色がとってもお気に入りです！\n・☆のモチーフが大好きです！\n\n【服装について】\n現在、使用しているモデルの色違いが実装予定なのですが\nまだ二面図などがなく、上半身のみのイラストがございます。\nそちらの画像を添付致しますのでご確認をお願い致します。（黒髪、赤インナーカラーのほうです！）\n\n【構図】\nおまかせします！（下半身の衣装がまだラフも仕上がっていないのでバストアップまでで大丈夫です！）\nサムネイルに使用したいので頭の先、衣装等、画面内に収まるよう描いていただけると幸いです。\nまた、逆光や影や夜など暗い色が強いもの、あまりに極端な煽り俯瞰構図もご遠慮いただけると嬉しいです。\n\n可能であれば表情差分ありましたら非常に嬉しいです…！\n\n【サイズ、納品形式】\nサイズもおまかせします。\nサムネイルでの使用にあたり、人物のみを分けた透過データもご納品をお願いできれば幸いです。\n\nご多忙かとは存じますが、ここまで読んでくださりましてありがとうございます。\n𝙉𝙔𝘼様が楽しく描いて頂けると嬉しいです！\n\nぜひご検討いただければと思います！\n宜しくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1F2yiHK623O-45M7RLr_zGJvdtXKMcuqk?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@NYAsan/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3906024, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f2ad6319/uploads/origins/1379f2a6-bdb6-4bb3-bf96-12f9162a8650?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19eaabae97aded0d128003f361fb2de2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f2ad6319/uploads/origins/1379f2a6-bdb6-4bb3-bf96-12f9162a8650?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19eaabae97aded0d128003f361fb2de2, https://si.imgix.net/f2ad6319/uploads/origins/1379f2a6-bdb6-4bb3-bf96-12f9162a8650?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00f9404d4340263f9eac1ec1d344cd5f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f2ad6319/uploads/origins/1379f2a6-bdb6-4bb3-bf96-12f9162a8650?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bac84a79958391ab398bb3371f206fb4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f2ad6319/uploads/origins/1379f2a6-bdb6-4bb3-bf96-12f9162a8650?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7dece8afedcc8ab1edc27b1cad84e003", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f2ad6319/uploads/origins/1379f2a6-bdb6-4bb3-bf96-12f9162a8650?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7dece8afedcc8ab1edc27b1cad84e003, https://si.imgix.net/f2ad6319/uploads/origins/1379f2a6-bdb6-4bb3-bf96-12f9162a8650?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2f78d6900873f59b43264610b3fa5a2c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f2ad6319/uploads/origins/1379f2a6-bdb6-4bb3-bf96-12f9162a8650?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ea902660ba1e8e10489a99bdcdc9e9bd 3x"}, "body": "初めまして^_ ̫ _^\nVTuber準備中の羽川ういと申します。\n\n\n𝙉𝙔𝘼 🚭💜様の描くイラストの淡い色使いがとても素敵でかわいいと思いリクエスト送らせていただきました🙇🏻⭐️\n\n\n【依頼内容】\n服装や髪型はそのまま描いていただきたく、表情や構図などは𝙉𝙔𝘼 🚭💜様の描きやすい形でお任せできれば幸いです！\nもし可能でしたら、全身が映るようなイラストにしていただけますとうれしいです。\n\n【キャラクター概要】\n・サキュバス\n・ピンクとねこがすき\n\n【使用用途】\n・Xへのツイート\n・収益のある配信サイトでのサムネイルでの使用\n\n【参考資料】\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/18IMu9zQJKInTw1PALAfZT1O_5x1pcJ5m/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nまた可能でしたら人物、背景の分かれたPSDデータまたはPNGデータをいただけるとありがたいです。\n\n金額的に厳しい場合、再送いただけますと幸いです。\n\nお忙しいと思いますが、ご検討の程よろしくお願いいたします🙇🏻", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@NYAsan/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3906024, "client_id": 3738345, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/308c4d7d/uploads/origins/e4db7e75-0105-4d0e-a820-9bd73ad4ba78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f5f6e43595b613d2bd3561bdcc0b509", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/308c4d7d/uploads/origins/e4db7e75-0105-4d0e-a820-9bd73ad4ba78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f5f6e43595b613d2bd3561bdcc0b509, https://si.imgix.net/308c4d7d/uploads/origins/e4db7e75-0105-4d0e-a820-9bd73ad4ba78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=122ec96e40da43db1deb1c97989c0d31 2x, https://si.imgix.net/308c4d7d/uploads/origins/e4db7e75-0105-4d0e-a820-9bd73ad4ba78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8aee8e002aef66ed209fedeeee81bb8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/308c4d7d/uploads/origins/e4db7e75-0105-4d0e-a820-9bd73ad4ba78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0d51caab9671f1aac44d768f383721dd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/308c4d7d/uploads/origins/e4db7e75-0105-4d0e-a820-9bd73ad4ba78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0d51caab9671f1aac44d768f383721dd, https://si.imgix.net/308c4d7d/uploads/origins/e4db7e75-0105-4d0e-a820-9bd73ad4ba78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e7e5acf57618c5ae48dd79a2bfa7dd05 2x, https://si.imgix.net/308c4d7d/uploads/origins/e4db7e75-0105-4d0e-a820-9bd73ad4ba78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=35727b9ddda06016a429f2015dfa510c 3x"}, "body": "hello, it's nice to meet you! i saw your cute illustrations and really wanted to make a request for a full body artwork of my character. please could you draw her in a maid outfit? i would be really happy if you made it very cute and related to her characteristics or interests in some way! for example, she really likes moons/stars, she loves reading, or that she is a nun (and her religious symbol is a bit like this: ✧, you can see it on her collar or necklace, on top of the moon, in the design). please give her a new hairstyle, but i'd like the little stars to stay in her hair. if you could try to draw a cute pose, i'd really like that, since i thought the one in your new drawing was so interesting and cute! i'd like her to have a very soft, calm and friendly smile with her lips slightly like :3. her reference is below. thank you very much, i hope you consider my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1rBWmLHxTLaA1Tq54II6FCS6OxUU9sfjG/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image",